msgid ""
"DisplayPort, is an MSP protocol extension that allows an autopilot to "
"remotely draw text on compatible external OSDs. DisplayPort, is an MSP "
"protocol extension that allows to remotely draw text characters/icons on "
"compatible external OSDs and allows High Definition (HD) as well as Standard"
" Definition (SD) displays."
msgstr ""
"DisplayPort是MSP协议的扩展，允许飞控远程在兼容的外部OSD上绘制文字。DisplayPort是MSP协议扩展，支持远程在兼容外部OSD上绘制文字字符/图标，并兼容高清（HD）和标清（SD）显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:8 099c827ce466433b8e4f57611bb1eeec
#: 3e40854140aa49809b300fb7b79c82c4 6d2d35989f404e4c9897deae3aa6bfe4
