"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` and ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` set the horizontal and vertical "
"position of the item, starting with ``X = 0`` and ``Y = 0`` in the upper "
"left corner of your screen."
msgstr ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` 和 ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` 设置项目的水平和垂直位置，以屏幕左上角的 ``X = 0`` 和 ``Y ="
" 0`` 为起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:75
#: 5335ae4d8c9947d48ea4bff77a638a97 80653a03bbe84adab5020181e9449ac6
#: 8aa64e149515418c9e9fe8e77d6169f6 8f4b0553ce274694983a48efa9b5241f
#: cb19883c638d499faef05dbe025c7b27
msgid ""
"the positioning parameters are not used for MSP telemetry only OSDs that "
"create the display only using the telemetry values."
msgstr "位置参数不适用于仅基于数传值创建显示的MSP数传OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:77
#: 4bd35821f25f4e95852b3706a22eae9a 580f633d6ddc448a84d12d034eb2a779
#: 83ff2545a521406597293b7b3de0931c c16f8c8a77644d1e89540e327d8ab38c
#: f3c9517c12c94d8998b2eaea6041fdec
msgid ""
"ArduPilot calculates a sensor-less airspeed estimate that is used if no "
"sensor is present or fails. ARSPD_TYPE must be set to zero in order to "
"display this value as the airspeed item, if no sensor is present."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot会计算无传感器空速估计值，在无传感器或传感器失效时使用。若无传感器，必须将ARSPD_TYPE设为零才能将该值显示为空速项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:82
#: 48c5b3127abe482a83acc90389272c1c 592747f28d304b19a4912f5a68812111
#: 76246607a89b45498d363e7d5089c15a be5ad1d40336481882c5dc7bef864045
#: f804875550d8484d85c0e2422378addc
msgid "Display Resolution and Fonts"
msgstr "显示分辨率与字体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:83
#: 2052b16505e84f52b6047ede11fd7ae9 59997a5c19714680a8e065d8050f7075
#: 6d87e70a5b4644c9a66fdd7a56b85117 c0fe98ed821a473ead45be453c67e487
#: dc579903f9b04c999db32d0977348cd4
msgid ""
"When using DisplayPort, you can select to display either the SD or HD fonts "
"using ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` for each OSD screen enabled. 0 = SD (30x16), 1 = HD "
"(50x18), 3 = HD (60x22)."
msgstr ""
"使用DisplayPort时，可通过为每个已启用的OSD屏幕设置 ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` 来选择显示SD或HD字体。0 = "
"SD（30×16），1 = HD（50×18），3 = HD（60×22）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:85
#: 28f3331d084f413c9ccc948d82ce9623 849ad449386d462c9b37bf5dc7c077f8
#: c048593d49c54a88ad1f22e824f2a2a9 c0d0671c21c94e9fb4f03e684cc24e3e
#: ecedeac7902345f8b9f59085249706e5
msgid ""
"For HDZero you should set ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` to 0 or 1 for each enabled OSD "
"screen. If you set it to 2, the text displayed will be garbled."
msgstr "对于HDZero，每个已启用的OSD屏幕应将 ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` 设为0或1。若设为2，显示文字将出现乱码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:87
#: 0c7d6b8705d5416897eb6b2617cba438 5f04abbd34874eb988fb6255cf6ef91e
#: 8592bb8d79264fb788f04a7fba3103f5 89068b4645514546811fb94d725b3926
#: d9fb25e1df8545aca8f6a5bf65028f14
msgid ""
"The SD font's positions are set on a 30x16 X/Y position grid as normal, the "
"HD uses a (1) 50x18 or (2) 60x22 grid. The 50x18 grid has margins at the "
"top/bottom/left/right of the screen before the grid begins."
msgstr ""
"SD字体位置按正常的30×16 X/Y位置网格设置，HD使用（1）50×18或（2）60×22网格。50×18网格在屏幕四周留有边距，然后才开始网格。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:89
#: 256d537343a24c0b994694a928944e0c 51ac85195bb1444d993a651ad0dc5839
#: 540c080bb1c54823a23afdbfa852799d 657ecef7a885497592d0e9c4b0e22d11
#: ae444f120b8d47cd9f8241761e37d036
msgid ""
"ArduPilot compatible fonts for WTFOS modified DJI goggles can be found "
"`**HERE** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WTFOS-"
"DJI>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"适用于WTFOS改装DJI眼镜的ArduPilot兼容字体可在 ` **此处** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WTFOS-"
"DJI>`_ _ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:91
#: 0594983dddd34c4b953b278ce1036dce 5f59e151e65743648f4102f3a6b980e1
#: 69900f841b84499db611e54708635a62 8aeac79d7bff4d01a9bed5c5d5cccd44
#: 953dfcf4d31741d48ed8ce80aee9cd40
msgid ""
"Walksnail/Avatar HD Goggles can select which font they use via a goggle "
"menu. A set of different style fonts that are ArduPilot compatible can be "
"found `**HERE** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WalkSnail>`__"
" . The following image shows the font styles included."
msgstr ""
"Walksnail/Avatar HD眼镜可通过眼镜菜单选择字体。一组ArduPilot兼容的不同风格字体可在 ` **此处** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WalkSnail>`_"
" _ 找到。下图展示了包含的字体风格。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:97
#: 1423445c13e14aaa95584ffe70dae9b5 2963c1b514cb4a168cb571216d48a365
#: 56c329278ad746c594a180c0c757ca53 7216ce6bf82b4ceba47cc46e0f5e73e9
#: e2577bdf57ba4f9bba2bf62f705ddbfc
msgid "Screens and screen switching"
msgstr "屏幕与屏幕切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:98
#: 1359d6a2be0b47a3a2c6993bc79b538b b60a9906600f4dbf900f6f3b29fbae80
#: c7480deeca7944b7a091153870cc1a93 cafe6a9610284b869ab0b68e5601215f
#: dfcf02327def4e73a7e253f90643f24e
msgid ""
"For multiple screen layouts, each screen's \"OSD\" parameter label is "
"trailed by a number, starting with \"1\". For example,  ``OSDn_<ITEM>_x`` is"
" a parameter \"x\" associated with screen 1's \"ITEM\" panel."
msgstr ""
"对于多屏幕布局，每个屏幕的「OSD」参数标签后跟一个数字，从「1」开始。例如，``OSDn_<ITEM>_x`` "
"是与屏幕1的「ITEM」面板关联的参数「x」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:100
#: 74342eafb5ed4f498bbe0063f315064a
msgid ""
"multiple screen layout switching is not avaialable on MSP telemetry only "
"OSDs unless the OSD itself provides the capability themselves."
msgstr "多屏幕布局切换在仅MSP数传OSD上不可用，除非OSD本身提供该功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:102
#: 59b5292f5a724eeb862a002baf21434c 6950b03a5f68476e8102f9298efc18cb
#: b36e9884449c42b0bf633ba36dcf4007 b41c61d29c79489c9e62e9fc8666c6a8
#: f98391fcde064897bc6f5166f791bf6d
msgid ""
"Set ``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` =1 to enable screen \"n\" display of this item. This "
"allows one to set individual items active on one screen but have them "
"switched off on another screen. Up to 4 screens are optionally available, "
"and can be individually enabled."
msgstr ""
"将 ``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` =1 "
"可启用屏幕「n」对该项目的显示。这样可以在一个屏幕上激活某些项目，而在另一个屏幕上关闭它们。最多可选用4个屏幕，每个均可单独启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:103
#: 24e09d7ebfde4f25961a23bb607f6f50 480e8a7fb84b4c9683d1d809de7fdf4f
#: ccd54e5489bb483a9a422d717eebbaaa e3d4a7a4eb534df78c2289843fe1addc
#: f877ea09b9f244f7b163143c1d862195
msgid ""
"Set parameters ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` and ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` to adjust RC channel "
"pwm limits to use for switching to a respective screen. Be sure to have the "
"ranges non-overlapping."
msgstr ""
"设置参数 ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` 和 ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` "
"来调整用于切换到相应屏幕的RC通道PWM限制值。请确保各范围不重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:105
#: 6d3a629afd3a4549be7c8856c37de5c6 a3f7454757d24040b69d29ebde593fae
#: d1b2a096ae0142e7992ca600d2dd1d40 f172b89693914e59a20e43502d874221
#: f67ba74fb4fc4967ab0da4ebda2bc07d
msgid ""
"There are different switch-method options to meet individual RC systems "
"switch layout requirements. These can be set by parameter: "
":ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>`. The options are:"
msgstr ""
"有不同的切换方法选项以满足各种 RC 系统开关布局的需求。可通过参数 :ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>` "
"进行设置。选项如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:108
#: 3bbfd93d412348a798253b8958747758 4c24224c7bbf499599985787cb2c16f5
#: 720a7f703935498f98e19153502d45ab cd581adc40734a55a5817065622ef964
#: d11ebd4660fb4692bb8e884d9d790f82
msgid ""
"0 = switches to next screen if the set RC channel's "
"(:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`) value is changed"
msgstr "0 = 当设定 RC 通道（:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`）的值改变时切换到下一个屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:109
#: 513a5ec1731e4316b8713ad4330e1e04 67d76272e91a45558ef7c0b3ef02b4ae
#: 970bc89ba7ed4d538d584a3adef01eb1 a5f9cc0d85054d7284fca666511ab20f
#: f0b36ed30fa04b5c8580206cc5dafb6b
msgid ""
"1 = directly selects a screen based on the set pwm limits for each "
"respective screen. RC channel value must change for new pwm value to be "
"recognized."
msgstr "1 = 根据每个屏幕设定的 PWM 限值直接选择屏幕。RC 通道值必须变化才能识别新的 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:110
#: 010a671d5f55491489770cde5e91c9c3 109ee5414d164b72bf402d28f45f30d4
#: 3b933e644dc54589b91fcbcad8a955e8 57c784e1b2254088b02f8cce4fd6b47c
#: cf77b4f5fa1a44a8996686eb64d0e80a
msgid ""
"2 = toggles screens on a low to high transition of set RC channel. keeps "
"toggling to next screen every second while channel value is kept high"
msgstr "2 = 在设定RC通道从低到高跳变时切换屏幕。当通道值保持高电平时，每秒持续切换到下一屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:112
#: 209f0679c0e84134ba10d9f7b06b6ad2 232415922e6e4a5f89bb8448f3a4aacc
#: 2c9be65ae8dc4ad5aa8e05d710aecd06 aa7df8169baf4d1cb9009fa66c4d1560
#: f1a601ee6be74eb88a9870eaec6468c9
msgid ""
"A limitation of telemetry based OSDs is that there's no way for ArduPilot to"
" add new panel items at will, it's the vendor's responsibility to add new "
"features by rolling out new firmware releases."
msgstr "基于数传的OSD的一个限制是ArduPilot无法随意添加新面板项目，新功能的添加依赖厂商推出新固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:115
#: 525b949407c54532b9261313c77898e4 731c57d7085d463f9930d08aa0f53802
#: 87442ea99bbf4d4b8da256adb3e1672b e0cc3e22bdb9457db36cfcbca85b86db
#: e7fcaddd9e654e0486fda1bdc6a6c949
msgid "Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen"
msgstr "在专用屏幕上显示统计信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:116
#: 02e5d5250d3548c29d6558796799da61 0c8e5aca104e4a7db7e83c6330f1e50e
#: 150f8feb2c0a42e18045b616de010256 6f4bbc032ceb4ca18c1ac8f8872f42b9
#: e2343076abc9442c8d0a74cf8cf90403
msgid ""
"Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen requires enabling at least one "
"extra screen by setting the respective ``OSDn_ENABLE`` to 1. By default, "
"ArduPilot has only one screen active so in a typical setup one would set "
"(:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`) = 1 and then enabling the OSD stats panel "
"on screen 2 by setting (:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`) = 1."
msgstr ""
"在专用屏幕上显示统计数据需要通过将相应的 ``OSDn_ENABLE`` 设置为 1 来启用至少一个额外屏幕。默认情况下，ArduPilot "
"只有一个屏幕处于激活状态，因此在典型设置中，应将（:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`）= "
"1，然后通过将（:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`）= 1 在屏幕 2 上启用 OSD 统计面板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:119
#: 5e9acc51c034432491d115b8074ecf1d 76fcec6ead8d44c2a7a449bb5dd176f9
#: d2dd360dd85c4c0abe9eaef766a6e1dc d5f1586c0c7a4af88561e524552eb694
#: eb6c4c650e2c4a04ab946f7a9d5abc16
msgid ""
"When the OSD switches to this screen it will check the value of the "
":ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>` parameter and if enabled it will "
"override the default behavior of the following OSD items:"
msgstr ""
"当 OSD 切换到该屏幕时，它将检查 :ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>` 参数的值，如果启用，它将覆盖以下 OSD "
"项的默认行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:121
#: 2969d6136a6d4a6d9e648bb2ed19bd8c 3ffa74bd14da4dc2a8e8ac7a498dba3e
#: 454d116eb5304803ae6e87cf9f0ebe70 683be071bdcd429ab4c59210d8803c81
#: e009608d128e410b99d3b1e666e85f67
msgid "OSDn_MESSAGE will display STATS followed by flight time"
msgstr "OSDn_MESSAGE 将显示 STATS，后跟飞行时间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:122
#: 103df72242b746b2a794a9aac7b5ef30 147a29255fc14962a952b67107c85da3
#: 33f3abc952cf443d81e77392d82398c9 981fb8b87e11466ab5d41d90e744fe97
#: b528343350e54e0e8d15937a7861f051
