msgstr "OSDn_ALTITUDE将显示最大高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:123
#: 339c240452694b0b89333f4958b2f8d8 57d0c932b5ea4dc99d50824dc21af7ff
#: 64a381233ff544ff9b11d7b3605ec186 cd77d78722b64975812d5080bf3d003d
#: cdb50661369c49c7a642f1ef2b9ab81e
msgid "OSDn_BAT_VOLT will display min voltage"
msgstr "OSDn_BAT_VOLT将显示最低电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:124
#: 4daf594f8ab14ae3a80d72ac30134c1b 76843a7511e748b2b30f3c8271e31307
#: a4c9453432234d6e9e5b7f9f379ffeff a524a972ebb24b3692aea3c9a6bb1a4b
#: c846fa8dd3e44f55acc8b7ee9ebd32a9
msgid "OSDn_CURRENT will display max current"
msgstr "OSDn_CURRENT将显示最大电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:125
#: 0fb8516df2b749ac9f811b255f0deda1 2f7da4b85e7a4e889ab4eeb5d3ef4779
#: 5af7f8be241b4231abab9953cdf9fc96 728854a390f44c01b263ba556c00e1d1
#: 996da60955db4c58961de616e9a9c22a
msgid ""
"OSDn_GSPEED will display max ground speed (or airspeed if ``OSDn_ASPEED_EN``"
" is set to 1)"
msgstr "OSDn_GSPEED 将显示最大地速（或空速，若 ``OSDn_ASPEED_EN`` 设置为 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:126
#: 6d88c1f70ace4ff7b99e69806b3c91b0 728b8ac53d8c4a57b1dc688f0b6a59b7
#: 90d6d5c66ee74e50b62287d388cdad5d cb8efb1abcbf4bcd93c98c51459e3a09
#: fd6dd2e5dfa3494c97a1d66f7b08a2bd
msgid ""
"OSDn_HOMEDIST will alternates max distance from home and total traveled "
"distance every 2 seconds"
msgstr "OSDn_HOMEDIST 每 2 秒交替显示距 Home 的最大距离和总飞行距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:127
#: 403efd627db04f7b949e966156b8776e 973c0c99ab754f82b35ed17f5983a888
#: bf4e8346a2a3478db0c85b43910a4729 d955a85d5f504c79bbcc9c5f52d51e37
#: f20cacbf34f543b6a7807ebe9f20606b
msgid "OSDn_RSSI will display min rssi"
msgstr "OSDn_RSSI将显示最低RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:131
#: 7dfacbfc0b3a46dda3048d012744b183 900eb19c661a4f96a096bf46628dcb42
#: 9f92de480b9e4600ad966eb471c4bf13 b3f72ab6c3b247faacfced7cc6e7a74f
#: fbaa9ec2cf114112b7686b46507434b4
msgid "Using Mission Planner to Configure the Layout"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 配置布局"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:132
#: 461c666f7a854250831c851687547867 745c2c6a6934490389f8305c1192f142
#: a66d701f97e24b4e93bb1549901ef5d6 c1bd6e24b886423b9bc94869d1fb904e
#: c565dedb1fae412b8e4a5bfb36f2518d
msgid ""
"Mission Planner(MP) has a tab in its CONFIG menu to configure the on-board "
"OSD many autopilots integrate, as well as setup layouts for Displayport "
"OSDs. This same configuration tab can be used to configure the OSD panels."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（MP）在其 CONFIG 菜单中有一个选项卡，用于配置许多飞控集成的板载 OSD，以及设置 DisplayPort "
"OSD 的布局。同样的配置选项卡也可用于配置 OSD 面板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:134
#: 2d26a9ea7b894643b7bbf6a5dbbbc7bd 74b94cfcab204197b48f0c26c781730a
#: b54a2f39556541829cd1983d1cd22d41 c5e547fa031a463d915dead5b01dd847
#: dd82ce80a41142b8aa9ddb5a88cad70a
msgid ""
"Mission Planners' OSD setup screen now supports HD OSD configuration. To "
"enable it check \"HD Layout\" in Editor Options at the top right of the OSD "
"screen you want to change."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的 OSD 设置界面现支持 HD OSD 配置。要启用，请在要更改的 OSD 屏幕右上角的编辑器选项中勾选「HD "
"Layout」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:140
#: 240d5ab7396d4202a2900fb063202736 2d2277f5aa814616bd552af796906642
#: 3395340e5ef24e3fbca3ca46b0ddd744 db238b18c2cb4800bd33c220ec60793d
#: e8f0800cfce748c48b4595804b2548bd
msgid ""
"You can change the MSP OSD display configuration by connecting Mission "
"Planner to SITL while the MSP OSD emulation window is active. By doing this,"
" you can adjust and tweak your OSD configuration using SITL without having "
"to worry about overheating your VTX. Once you are done you can take the OSD "
"parameters you have settled on and move them to your vehicle."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 MSP OSD 模拟窗口处于活动状态时，通过将 Mission Planner 连接到 SITL 来更改 MSP OSD "
"显示配置。这样你无需担心 VTX 过热，即可在 SITL 中调整 OSD 配置。完成后，可以将确定的 OSD 参数迁移到实际飞行器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:142
#: 11132cd6e3a6498b8ae3d5b7d0329ce7 18328c1e36c84cf288acaa08f1f8f6c7
#: 61e8c587ad464d5eb15377eb80ba7e64 8590d3c72c4546c0beefa31811f411c6
#: fa8fb72074a04fea8d5bec5eee5c6a9f
msgid ""
"Mission Planner can be connected running on the same computer, or networked "
"computer, to MAVProxy, using this command in MAVProxy:"
msgstr "Mission Planner 可以在同一台电脑上运行，也可以在联网的电脑上通过以下 MAVProxy 命令连接到 MAVProxy："

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:148
#: 57a5e0fb0b674582b0504e59dd40029b 83bf6613b8cb4d5c93afa898b6f1c04f
#: a7999810da9b4dbf93e3f281ad0c8e94 cffd258c751b42c98875f2c8733321ec
#: f62a323f910d4203a58260a38e87d182
msgid ""
"if MP is running on the same PC, the ip address would be 127.0.0.1 (local "
"host address)"
